{
  "question": "What explains the statistically significant upward drift observed in the resonator_obs instrument (z = 2.33), while the other pendulum and resonator instruments remain stable and no clear environmental or level changes have been recorded?",
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "label": "H1: Random statistical fluctuation",
